6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>溯寻\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>田中有纪\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【byThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zJNbenEvH\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zJNbenEvH</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>一位神秘莫测、带着异域气质的射手，不知为何目的来到伊利亚。她所到之处，总会留下一片黑色的羽毛。在妮蒂娅的国度，她被称作“告死鸟”，人们相信“告死鸟”的出现预示着这片土地即将被死亡笼罩。妮蒂娅沉默寡言，极少与人交谈，但她并非不善言辞，只是习惯于隐藏心绪，不轻易透露任何信息和行踪。对于被视为“死亡”的象征，她早已习以为常，甚至也觉得自己会带来厄运，因此鲜少与人接触。<br />她的眼睛蕴涵着强大的力量，似乎能看穿灵魂。她擅长弓箭，也善于在暗处观察局势。妮蒂娅本性正直善良，对不择手段的胜利嗤之以鼻，也常会默默向弱者伸出援手，颇有几分惩恶扬善的侠客之姿。\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022025031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.236 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.396 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1733/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49841/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5189/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 399/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  279.041      1 模板:角色\n100.00%  279.041      1 -total\n 59.38%  165.688      1 模板:技能树\n 49.19%  137.270     14 模板:技能图\n  4.57%   12.758      1 模板:个性图\n  4.57%   12.748      1 模板:面包屑\n  4.36%   12.173      1 模板:极限解放图\n  1.69%    4.726      1 模板:立绘\n  1.52%    4.239      1 模板:兵种图\n  0.93%    2.594      2 模板:阵营图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:5365-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022025031 and revision id 16689. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"角色","missing":true},{"sort